# Open this file in VS Code with the REST Client extension
# (humao.rest-client) and click "Send Request" above each block.
#
# Swagger UI lives at:
#   http://localhost:8080/api-docs/index.html
# OpenAPI JSON:
#   http://localhost:8080/api-docs/doc.json

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{host}}/healthz

### 1) Create a product
POST {{host}}/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Espresso Beans 1kg",
  "description": "Single-origin Ethiopian roast",
  "sale_price": 24.50,
  "price": 29.90
}

### 2) Create a product without optional fields
POST {{host}}/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plain Mug",
  "price": 9.99
}

### 3) Patch a product — change only the price
# Replace the id with a real one from #1.
PATCH {{host}}/product/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 31.50
}

### 4) Patch a product — null out description and sale_price
PATCH {{host}}/product/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": null,
  "sale_price": null
}

### 5) Patch a product — invalid (negative price)
PATCH {{host}}/product/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": -1
}
